ck_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106365","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106365","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106365.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106365.patch","merged_at":"2025-05-15T15:29:33Z"},"body":"A follow-on to #106317.\r\n\r\nEnsure modifier key events are pushed to the `Input` system when Godot is activated. This is important for actions that read modifier keys to alter their own behaviour. An example is clicking the zoom in / out buttons to force integer zoom:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d32d2e9b511dbdce4e79621a92c63088c9912ad0/editor/gui/editor_zoom_widget.cpp#L54\r\n\r\nAn example of this working, where Godot is not focused, but correctly handles the integer zoom:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5cdc7e42-118a-40cb-b6cf-cd9f40cae3e3\r\n\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n>\r\n> The mouse click event does have the correct modifier state, but Godot reads the keyboard pressed state, and therefore we push these special set of keys. A more reliable approach would be to raise two separate events, or allow the `pressed` event to optionally include the source event, ","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106365/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106365/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}